// Cone burst of cold, same Shockwave shape as
// assets/common/abilities/spells/evocation/frost_fingers.ron (Wave 1's own
// circle-1 cone-cold sibling) -- Shockwave is the only AoE variant with a
// real RON-configurable damage_kind field (set directly, not hardcoded per
// sub-kind the way MeleeConstructorKind/Explosion/GroundAoe/BasicBeam are),
// so Cold is exactly representable, no drift. `shockwave_speed`/
// `shockwave_duration` are tuned so `speed * duration` (~8.8 m) approximates
// the sheet's 9 m cone reach, the same approximation frost_fingers already
// makes for its own 5 m cone.
//
// The sheet's own "left sluggish" rider IS modeled, via the same `Slowed`
// BuffKind ray_of_frost.ron already established as the generic movement-slow
// primitive -- attached through `damage_effect`, the field Shockwave exposes
// for exactly this purpose (see frost_fingers.ron's own `damage_effect: None`
// for where this would otherwise sit unused).
Shockwave(
    energy_cost: 55,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    swing_duration: 0.3,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    damage: 26.0,
    poise_damage: 10,
    knockback: (strength: 0.0, direction: Away),
    shockwave_angle: 60.0,
    shockwave_vertical_angle: 45.0,
    shockwave_speed: 22.0,
    shockwave_duration: 0.4,
    dodgeable: Jump,
    move_efficiency: 0.1,
    damage_kind: Cold,
    specifier: Ice,
    ori_rate: 1.0,
    damage_effect: Some(Buff((
        kind: Slowed,
        dur_secs: 5,
        strength: Value(0.3),
        chance: 1.0,
    ))),
    timing: PostBuildup,
    emit_outcome: true,
    minimum_combo: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane), cooldown: Some(9.0)),
)
